  <item>
    <title>03. 夏日心愿：说走就走的旅行，欧洲旅游目的地推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668a11c7ae8e21859a0c05e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668a11c7ae8e21859a0c05e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jul 2024 03:55:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：挠挠、养羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期看点：</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 深圳独行记：因三毛《撒哈拉沙漠》引发的一场名为自由的“出走”</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 欧洲旅行达人攻略：颜值最高的国家推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏天和青春拥有同一种生命力，热烈与自由令人恋恋不忘。正值暑假毕业季，你也很期待来一场说走就走的旅行吧！你最想去哪里呢？我们分享了国内游、国外游的玩法和体验，希望您的旅途也充满浪漫和喜悦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a>深圳:独行记</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZBwiq7iAUScjL2iSBFi9i5v_Ie.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="537">8:57</a>摩洛哥：篝火晚会趣事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8yR4yyQzc9O9jhO_tJV5lhGKxQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLn33Qo8TGs9mqvYIBNdnzwTSBL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a>内蒙古：篝火大型蹦迪现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a>独自旅行的优缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a>庆祝香港回归27周年</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyLFJ6TTqxJaHHbBXG1se3QmCoq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdqtiQg12_D5atyc0bjoW4QrDYe.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRXsHscpRkexox3hAfsIjz4WWnx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a>香港：好吃到半夜哭泣的美食</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvZe0NtshfzkqtPtNL2xgKPzE-RJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuECQPn6jRZoXIENiEX2aagezG8H.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDC64dBSYhrGeca-sIcKgi44GUJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkreujxjLSah6YZqZBbtvzp-fCRw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a>欧洲篇：红黑榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a>希腊：独特传统风土人情</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxJdjtu2kMFhNiXBjC_PkpL_dgc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7JBwK_QRFZu2VFxn_HLoa6QKB2.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtWlsH-NPfh199crLVNesfRiJog2.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_l2qYjgIqgo4IoFLYPAlVoSo_X.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1ayEyamCTikD2oVTl_almHQZKf.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmljLJua7AHjTmRdTsU-2dvogM7p.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a>瑞士： 冒险与梦幻美景</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhCiDyStrgL2UWIrWYZfJQ5lHRTw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjeKGDVGZLpuQgF4yymFqMFvS6kW.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmY9Oc9ZwfRHzXPYt3Jb7SToHBTg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhkFR2hTA9eaBDnsXviIq6BTML_p.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>西班牙：人一定要去一次圣家堂！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_0G-LThsJmsZTCfHsx3uyIwPbO.HEIC"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuULalqiFLf7149ofsE6VB_PbxU2.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZCdvdOxzdjO_9mIgYYntpgwwJ1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft6qhwNm7-4QnjXU9ObncZ4JFXlN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fko2hLdGnubg-6yDXiEnuaaojBgT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiu3lFWfZ_3RdtcOWu1epcgNXB4W.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a>意大利：夏季太热</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDt-kXek-_b9xcM4jmnWzWg7zg5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a>欧洲自由行的优缺点</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容仅供娱乐，拒绝一切参考！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>想去海边-夏日入侵企画</span></p>]]></description>
